@Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5260

### Process health
GET {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/health/live
Accept: application/json

### MySQL readiness (200 Healthy / 503 Unhealthy)
GET {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Register with email and password (returns a bearer token and sets a session cookie)
POST {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "owner@example.com",
  "password": "change-me-please",
  "displayName": "Example Team"
}

### Current authenticated user
GET {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### Knowledge usage (replace the development tenant header when required)
GET {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/knowledge/usage
Accept: application/json

### Upload a company knowledge file (PDF/DOCX/Markdown/TXT, max 100 MB)
POST {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/knowledge/documents
Idempotency-Key: knowledge-example-1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=knowledge-boundary

--knowledge-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="product.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Product name and supported scenarios.
--knowledge-boundary--

### Search brand knowledge (replace site ID)
POST {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sites/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/knowledge/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "product supported scenarios",
  "scopeMode": "default",
  "topK": 8
}

### Current onboarding tenant, brand and step
GET {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/onboarding
Accept: application/json

### Create the first brand for the authenticated team
POST {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/onboarding/brands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Example",
  "primaryDomain": "example.com",
  "reportTitle": "Example visibility report",
  "includeSubdomains": true
}

### Read onboarding progress (replace site ID)
GET {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/onboarding/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Start asynchronous brand research (replace site ID)
POST {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/sites/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/brand-research
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "website": "https://example.com",
  "maxPrompts": 30,
  "maxCompetitors": 10,
  "refreshKey": "example-first-research"
}

### List global research Provider metadata (system-admin session required; credentials are masked)
GET {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/research/providers
Accept: application/json

### Configure an OpenAI-compatible research Provider (system-admin session required)
PUT {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/research/providers/openai-compatible
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "gpt-6-luna",
  "apiUrl": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
  "credential": "<provider-api-key>",
  "enabled": true,
  "priority": 10,
  "webSearchEnabled": false,
  "timeoutSeconds": 90
}

### Save Cloro global URL/switch (system-admin session; apiKey is optional and only fills the `default` pool account)
PUT {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/providers/cloro/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "apiUrl": "https://api.cloro.dev/v1/async/task",
  "enabled": true
}

### List Cloro pool accounts (system-admin session; only the last 4 key characters are returned)
GET {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/providers/cloro/keys
Accept: application/json

### Add a Cloro account (one account/organization = one key; validated with GET /v1/credits unless skipValidation)
POST {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/providers/cloro/keys
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountLabel": "account-b",
  "apiKey": "<cloro-key-of-another-account>",
  "priority": 100,
  "enabled": true,
  "skipValidation": false
}

### Change priority / disable an account (the key itself cannot be changed)
PATCH {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/providers/cloro/keys/<key-id>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priority": 50,
  "enabled": false
}

### Refresh one account's credits
POST {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/providers/cloro/keys/<key-id>/refresh-credits

### Archive an account (409 CLORO_KEY_IN_USE while submitted tasks still use it)
DELETE {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/providers/cloro/keys/<key-id>

### Pool overview
GET {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/providers/cloro/pool
Accept: application/json

### Test a Cloro task (system-admin session; consumes credits of the selected account)
POST {{Jogeoai.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/providers/cloro/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "chatgpt",
  "prompt": "What are the best products for...",
  "country": "US"
}
